  "question": {
    "text": "Sum of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math>-bonds present in peroxodisulphuric acid and pyrosulphuric acid is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The structure of peroxodisulphuric acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/afe5e9bd-b50d-4f4a-804c-11f9441fc028-9894294.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 178px;\" /></p><p>Each sulphur is having&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;bonds. Hence, total number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>-bonds in peroxydisulphuric acid is four.</p><p>The structure of pyrosulphuric&nbsp;acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cf0481f3-bbc8-4e4f-b5d4-76da9b36cd0b-9894294_2.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 183px;\" /></p><p>Each sulphur is having&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;bonds. Hence, total number of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>-bonds in pyrosulphuric&nbsp;acid is four.</p><p>So, sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;bonds present = 4 + 4 = 8</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
